<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>Hello <%= @appointment_request.guest_name %>,</h1>

    <p>Unfortunately, your appointment request could not be confirmed because the time slot is no longer available.</p>

    <h2>Request Details</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Nutritionist:</strong> <%= @nutritionist.name %></li>
      <li><strong>Requested Date:</strong> <%= @appointment_request.requested_at.strftime("%B %d, %Y at %H:%M") %></li>
    </ul>

    <p>Another guest has already booked this time slot. We encourage you to book a different time or try another nutritionist.</p>

    <p><a href="<%= nutritionists_url %>">Search for nutritionists</a></p>

    <p>Best regards,<br>The NutriWA Team</p>
  </body>
</html>
